# AE-20 — layer 4: a drain resume first CONFIRMS it owns the run (the top-level
# session claimed it with fleet-resume claim), then runs the checkpoint, then
# re-dispatches the PARKED Mission into its existing worktree (no new
# wt-preflight). DND-443 critic round 3: at most one admiral owns a run.
invariant = drain resume: confirm ownership, checkpoint, then re-dispatch PARKED into its existing worktree
home      = athena:admiral-resume (drain resume bullet) + athena:fleet-drain
mode      = next-action
expect_order = fleet-resume.status < agent.spawn-captain:DND-701
expect_order = fleet-control.check < agent.spawn-captain:DND-701
forbid_action = wt-preflight:dnd-701
